{"text":"The pipeline is complete, deterministic (reruns produce identical output), and all required artifacts exist.\n\n## What was built\n\n`src/dq_audit/audit.py` implements the full pipeline, exposed via `python -m dq_audit.cli run --config configs/public_audit.yml --out-dir outputs` and `experiments/run_audit_suite.py`.\n\n**Cleaning** — whitespace/ID/date/enum/money normalization; dates parsed from ISO, `MM/DD/YYYY`, `YYYY/MM/DD`, `DD-MM-YYYY`; amounts (`$120.50`, `33.10`, `100`, cents) converted to integer cents.\n\n**Quarantine** — 37 rows quarantined with stable reason codes (`invalid_email`, `invalid_tier`, `invalid_status`, `invalid_currency`, `invalid_amount`, `invalid_date`, `invalid_country`, `invalid_method`, `invalid_reason`, `duplicate_primary_key`, `invalid_primary_key`, `unknown_customer`, `unknown_order`, `refund_exceeds_order_amount`, `missing_email`). Duplicates keep first valid occurrence; no rows are silently dropped.\n\n**Great Expectations 0.18.21** — ephemeral fluent context validates all four cleaned dataframes against the rule YAML (not-null, unique, regex, in_set, min checks): **55/55 expectations pass, 4/4 checkpoint suites pass**, plus 3 cross-table referential checks (all pass, no orphans).\n\n**Reconciliation** — per-order settled-payment / processed-refund / net-collected math with status-specific balanced rules. 6 orders total, 4 balanced; O009 and O012 are unbalanced (O009: net 425 ≠ 525; O012: net 10000 ≠ 100), which is the single honest reason `overall_pass=False` — the reconciliation check for completed orders correctly fails.\n\n**Reports** — `validation_report.json` (metadata, row counts, per-dataset expectation results, cross-table checks, reconciliation checks, quarantine reason counts, failed expectations, `overall_pass`), `reconciliation_report.json` (totals + per-order rows matching the required schema), and `audit_summary.md` with exactly the required section headings, all mutually consistent.","model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","usageKnown":true,"usage":{"input":759,"output":458,"cacheRead":30912,"cacheWrite":0},"toolCalls":[],"stopReason":"stop"}